    "title": "listed items + 等",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk4-connectors-p16-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "listed items + 等",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "等 after listed nouns leaves the list open to similar items. It does not mean waiting or equality in this position.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我买了苹果、香蕉等水果。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ mǎi le píngguǒ 、 xiāngjiāo děng shuǐguǒ 。",
                "meaning": "I bought fruit such as apples and bananas.",
                "audio": "6bd08c869672282f8d9c8f5e12bbe37f13e20057cbbcbfd3af6427fd927bd171"
              },
              {
                "text": "老师、学生等都来了。",
                "pinyin": "lǎoshī 、 xuéshēng děng dōu lái le 。",
                "meaning": "Teachers, students, and others all came.",
                "audio": "a703438787d00373e418aadbdb6cd511bb5dbb8419466e4593d2e5c725851e4a"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "Words used in this pattern",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "等",
                "pinyin": "děng",
                "meaning": "and so on (list-ending particle)",
                "singleWord": true,
